# Umami Cloud — analytics for the live House.
#
# The website id is not a secret: it ships inside the page for every visitor
# to read, exactly like a Google Analytics measurement id. Keep it in a GitHub
# Actions *variable* (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables),
# not a secret, so the deploy log stays readable.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` if you ever want to see events from a local
# `npm run build && npm run preview`. Plain `npm run dev` never reports —
# analytics.js requires a production build.
VITE_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=

# Only if you self-host Umami instead of using cloud.umami.is.
# VITE_UMAMI_HOST=https://analytics.example.com
